    // #391: chat's null-budget_id fallback must honor the viewer's per-viewer
    // active-budget preference (#255's `users.active_budget_id`) instead of only
    // ever looking at the OWNER-scoped `budgets.is_default` column. A sharee who
    // has activated a shared budget must land there, not on their own default.
